comment = "mac_capability MAC policy modules for the 5BSD capability subsystem"

desc = <<EOD
Kernel MAC policy modules implementing the mac_capability security model that
authorityd(8) and serviced(8) build on: message-passing capability channels,
credential identity nonces, isolation enforcement, capability-protection
shields, coalitions, nodes, accounting, mount and system gates.
EOD
